---
description: How to work on the jev-orchestrator CLI
alwaysApply: true
---

- This repo is the jev-orchestrator CLI. Protocol v1 is `docs/protocol.md`.
- Run `npm test` after a behaviour change. `npm run demo` must keep refusing the second claim.
- Do not add a network call to claim, handoff, or the demo.
- Do not invent Codex config keys. Adapters are `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md` (`@AGENTS.md`), `.cursor/rules/*.mdc`, and `.devin/rules/*.md`.
- Consumer copy that `init` writes lives in `adapters/protocol.md`, not in this rule.
